From a28f4990245d1290b264c1c9d417320a4435b548 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Solomon <solomonjohnc818@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 16:11:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Fix MCP add/connect OAuth flow and add progressive discovery

Bug fixes (add flow never launched login / never stored api_key):
- dawn-ui/src/app/mcp/page.tsx handleAdd: connect the created server by the
  id returned from createMCPServer instead of re-finding by name after the
  form is cleared (formName reset to "" made the find always return null, so
  handleConnect never fired and OAuth was never probed).
- dawn-ui/src/app/mcp/page.tsx handleConnect: proactively probe OAuth for
  HTTP servers (GET /oauth/status) before doing a doomed unauthenticated
  connect, launching the consent popup immediately (Claude-connector flow).
  Kept the reactive fallback for when the connect itself reports a challenge.
- dawn-api/routers/mcp.py: add GET /mcp/servers/{id}/oauth/status (proactive
  probe) and PUT /mcp/tools/{id}/pin (pin/unpin a discovered tool).
- dawn-api/tools/mcp_server.py: replace the fragile string-match OAuth probe
  with _probe_requires_oauth() that runs the spec probe on any HTTP connect
  or discovery failure; add check_oauth_status() for the proactive endpoint.

Progressive discovery (Anthropic client best-practice model):
- Stop eagerly registering every discovered MCP tool as a first-class
  mcp_<name> DAWN tool at startup (blows up context window as servers grow).
- Add mcp_search_tools meta-tool (catalog: {server, name, description} across
  all enabled servers) and mcp_call_tool meta-tool (lazy connect + execute).
- load_persisted_mcp_tools now registers only the two meta-tools plus any
  tools explicitly pinned by the user.
- _persist_tools persists to the catalog but only (re)registers pinned tools.
- New migration 019 adds the `pinned` column to mcp_tools.
- dawn-ui/src/lib/api.ts: add pinned to MCPTool, plus checkMCPOAuthStatus and
  pinMCPTool helpers.
